part plan
  tally 2
  note "The walk from 2026. Up to the end of 2025 the places are read from the observations and readings (statements/statements.tally, records.tally); the plan's movements are booked from walk_from on, the day after the records end, except the Lazur reserve's interest, booked from the day after its last statement (the Lazur account has no statements after it)."
  note "From 2026: the pay into the joint account, the standing orders, our card spending (a hole: no records and no plan), A-HR1 v2 on the 15th (hr1_take) and A-HR4 (zosia_save), into the wrapped account and Tomek's Rzeka account. The purchases the money makes (A-D11, A-D12) and the next car (A-HR3) exist only in the forecast (when fc_on): in the base a plan movement on a 15th whose year's holidays no row gives yet has a hole for its day, which makes every binding over its kind a hole, history included (G-MP-2, S:306), and would spoil A-05's lots and sales. In the forecast (scenarios/forecast.tally) a plan of fixed sums (fc_take) stands in for A-HR1 v2 from February 2026, and January's investing and Zosia's transfer are left out (story § The forecast, item 1)."
  note "The 15th's money goes through inv_transit, a place of the model's own, so the wrapped account's share and Rzeka's are each taken from what the rule took, not from a balance read again after the first transfer (awkward)."

index lazq = month 2025-07..2025-10 by 3
  note "the quarters after the last Lazur statement to the end of 2025; the savings accounts stay outside the forecast (story § The forecast, item 4)"

place inv_transit: accounts DUK lives 2021-01-01..

input card_spend[m in month]: money DUK question "How much do we spend by card from the joint account in this month?"

input fc_fixed[y in tax_year]: money DUK question "What fixed sum does the forecast invest on each 15th of this year (story § The forecast, item 1)?"

input fc_on: bool question "Does the forecast's walk apply (story § The forecast)?"

input fc_fixed_from: month question "From which month does the forecast invest a fixed sum?"

input hr3_units_0_0001: num glb
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input laz_last_stmt: date question "On which day does the last Lazur statement end?"

input laz_rate: rate question "What yearly rate does the Lazur savings account pay (A-D31, A-D32)?"

input plan_until: month question "Up to which month does the walk book the model's own movements?"

input r_units_0_0001: num glb
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input w_bnd_money_2: int
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input w_bnd_units_0_0001: num bnd
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input w_glb_units_0_0001: num glb
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input walk_from: date question "From which day does the walk book the model's own movements?"

def fc_live[m in month]: bool at start_of(m)
  note "the forecast's fixed sums run from fc_fixed_from (story § The forecast, item 1); outside the forecast, never"
  rule base = fc_on and m >= fc_fixed_from

def floor_now[m in month]: money DUK at rule_day[m]
  note "A-HR1 v2 .2: the floor"
  rule base = hr1_floor + due[m] + card_avg[m]

def hr1_live[m in month]: bool at start_of(m)
  note "A-HR1 v2 decides the 15th; in the forecast it is left out (story § The forecast, item 1)"
  rule base = not fc_on

def hr3_units[m in month]: num glb at start_of(m)
  note "A-HR3: enough BRZ-GLB-A to bring 45 000.00 DUK, units to 4 places, rounded up"
  rule base = round(hr3_amount / px[glb, rule_day[m]], hr3_units_0_0001, up)

def hr4_live[m in month]: bool at start_of(m)
  note "A-HR4 from its start; in the forecast January's transfer is left out (story § The forecast, item 1)"
  rule base = not fc_on or m >= fc_fixed_from

def hr3_go[m in month]: bool at rule_day[m]
  note "A-HR3: on a 15th, after that day's investing, once only: Tomek's Rzeka account worth 60 000.00 DUK or more, and its BRZ-GLB-A worth 45 000.00 DUK or more"
  rule none = false
  rule on beats none v hr3_v1 = rzt_worth_now[m] >= hr3_threshold and bal(rzt_glb) * px[glb, rule_day[m]] >= hr3_amount when flows(hr3_sell.units, walk_from..(rule_day[m] - 1 day)) == 0

def rzt_worth_now[m in month]: num DUK at start_of(m)
  note "A-HR3: Tomek's Rzeka account at this point of the day, its cash and its units at the day's prices"
  rule base = bal(rzt_cash) + bal(rzt_glb) * px[glb, rule_day[m]] + bal(rzt_div) * px[div, rule_day[m]] + bal(rzt_idx) * px[idx, rule_day[m]] + bal(rzt_em) * px[em, rule_day[m]]

def inv_want[m in month]: money DUK at rule_day[m]
  note "A-HR1 v2 .1: everything in the joint account above the floor, read at this point of the day"
  rule v2 v hr1_v2 = max(0, bal(joint) - floor_now[m])

def laz_gross[q in lazq]: money DUK at start_of(q)
  note "A-D31: the daily balances times the yearly rate over 365 days (simple, Actual/365 Fixed: the balances' sum accrued for one day), credited on the quarter's last day; that day's balance is the day before's"
  rule base = round(accrue(sum(bal(lazur, d) for d in day where d >= start_of(q) and d < end_of(q) - 1 day) + bal(lazur, end_of(q) - 1 day - 1 day), laz_rate, start_of(q), start_of(q) + 1 day, act365, simple), minor(DUK), half-up)

def laz_net[q in lazq]: money DUK at start_of(q)
  note "A-D31, PIT-8 .7: credited less the 19 % tax withheld, the tax rounded (GEN-5 .1)"
  rule base = laz_gross[q] - round(laz_gross[q] * pit8_rate, 1, half-up)

def plan_to[m in month]: bool = m <= plan_until at start_of(m)

def r_c[m in month]: money DUK = flows(invest_rzk[m], rule_day[m]..rule_day[m]) at start_of(m)

def r_fee[m in month]: money DUK at rule_day[m]
  note "A-D12 .1: 0.25 % of the money placed, at least 5.00 DUK, rounded to the ort; the money placed is what arrived, as the register books it (rzk-4471-07-anna.csv line 7: 37 518.00 DUK arrived, fee 93.80 DUK)"
  rule base = max(rzk_fee_min, round(r_c[m] * rzk_fee_rate, minor(DUK), half-up))

def r_units[m in month]: num glb at start_of(m)
  note "A-D12 .1, A-HR1 v2 .4: BRZ-GLB-A at the day's price, units to 4 places, rounded down; what isn't invested stays as cash"
  rule base = round((r_c[m] - r_fee[m]) / px[glb, rule_day[m]], r_units_0_0001, down)

def taken_today[m in month]: money DUK = flows(hr1_take[m], rule_day[m]..rule_day[m]) + flows(fc_take[m], rule_day[m]..rule_day[m]) at start_of(m)

def w_bnd_money[m in month]: money DUK at start_of(m)
  note "A-D11 .1, A-HR1 .3: half to each fund; an odd ort goes to GLB"
  rule base = round(wrap_c[m] / w_bnd_money_2, minor(DUK), down)

def w_bnd_units[m in month]: num bnd at start_of(m)
  note "A-D11 .1: units to 4 places, rounded down"
  rule base = round(w_bnd_money[m] / px[bnd, rule_day[m]], w_bnd_units_0_0001, down)

def w_glb_money[m in month]: money DUK = wrap_c[m] - w_bnd_money[m] at start_of(m)

def w_glb_units[m in month]: num glb at start_of(m)
  note "A-D11 .1: units to 4 places, rounded down"
  rule base = round(w_glb_money[m] / px[glb, rule_day[m]], w_glb_units_0_0001, down)

def wrap_c[m in month]: money DUK = flows(invest_wrap[m], rule_day[m]..rule_day[m]) at start_of(m)

def wrap_room_now[m in month]: money DUK at rule_day[m]
  note "PIT-9 .2: the year's limit less what the walk has paid into the wrapped account this year"
  rule base = max(0, wrap_limit - flows(invest_wrap, start_of(year_of(m))..(rule_day[m] - 1 day)))

move cards[m in month where start_of(m) >= walk_from and plan_to[m]]: transfers
  on window(start_of(m), end_of(m) - 1 day)
  at start_of(m)
  when m <= plan_until and start_of(m) >= walk_from
  leg cash from joint to world amount card_spend[m]

move fc_take[m in month where start_of(m) >= walk_from and plan_to[m] and fc_live[m]]: transfers
  on rule_day[m]
  at start_of(m)
  when m <= plan_until and rule_day[m] >= walk_from and fc_live[m]
  leg cash from joint to inv_transit amount fc_fixed[year_of(m)]

move hr1_take[m in month where start_of(m) >= walk_from and plan_to[m] and hr1_live[m]]: transfers
  on rule_day[m]
  at start_of(m)
  when m <= plan_until and rule_day[m] >= walk_from and hr1_live[m]
  reads joint
  leg cash from joint to inv_transit amount inv_want[m]

move hr3_car[m in month where start_of(m) >= walk_from and plan_to[m]]: transfers
  on rule_day[m]
  at start_of(m)
  when m <= plan_until and fc_on and rule_day[m] >= walk_from and flows(hr3_sell[m].cash, rule_day[m]..rule_day[m]) > 0
  reads hr3_sell
  leg cash from rzt_cash to world amount hr3_amount

move hr3_sell[m in month where start_of(m) >= walk_from and plan_to[m]]: fund_sales
  on rule_day[m]
  at start_of(m)
  when m <= plan_until and fc_on and rule_day[m] >= walk_from and hr3_go[m]
  reads hr3_sell, rzt_cash, rzt_div, rzt_em, rzt_glb, rzt_idx
  after invest_rzk
  after rbuy
  leg units from rzt_glb to market amount hr3_units[m]
  leg cash from market to rzt_cash amount round(hr3_units[m] * px[glb, rule_day[m]], minor(DUK), half-up)
  leg fee from rzt_cash to market amount 0

move rbuy[m in month where start_of(m) >= walk_from and plan_to[m]]: fund_buys
  on rule_day[m]
  at start_of(m)
  when m <= plan_until and fc_on and rule_day[m] >= walk_from
  reads invest_rzk
  leg units from market to rzt_glb amount if r_c[m] > 0 then r_units[m] else 0
  leg cash from rzt_cash to market amount if r_c[m] > 0 then round(r_units[m] * px[glb, rule_day[m]], minor(DUK), half-up) else 0
  leg fee from rzt_cash to market amount if r_c[m] > 0 then r_fee[m] else 0

move wbuy_bnd[m in month where start_of(m) >= walk_from and plan_to[m]]: wrap_buys
  on rule_day[m]
  at start_of(m)
  when m <= plan_until and fc_on and rule_day[m] >= walk_from
  reads invest_wrap
  leg units from market to wrap_bnd amount if wrap_c[m] > 0 then w_bnd_units[m] else 0
  leg cash from wrap_cash to market amount if wrap_c[m] > 0 then round(w_bnd_units[m] * px[bnd, rule_day[m]], minor(DUK), half-up) else 0

move wbuy_glb[m in month where start_of(m) >= walk_from and plan_to[m]]: wrap_buys
  on rule_day[m]
  at start_of(m)
  when m <= plan_until and fc_on and rule_day[m] >= walk_from
  reads invest_wrap
  leg units from market to wrap_glb amount if wrap_c[m] > 0 then w_glb_units[m] else 0
  leg cash from wrap_cash to market amount if wrap_c[m] > 0 then round(w_glb_units[m] * px[glb, rule_day[m]], minor(DUK), half-up) else 0

move invest_rzk[m in month where start_of(m) >= walk_from and plan_to[m]]: transfers
  on rule_day[m]
  at start_of(m)
  when m <= plan_until and rule_day[m] >= walk_from
  reads hr1_take, invest_wrap
  leg cash from inv_transit to rzt_cash amount taken_today[m] - wrap_c[m]

move invest_wrap[m in month where start_of(m) >= walk_from and plan_to[m]]: transfers
  on rule_day[m]
  at start_of(m)
  when m <= plan_until and rule_day[m] >= walk_from
  reads hr1_take, invest_wrap
  leg cash from inv_transit to wrap_cash amount min(taken_today[m], wrap_room_now[m])

move laz_interest[q in lazq]: transfers
  on end_of(q) - 1 day
  at start_of(q)
  when start_of(q) > laz_last_stmt
  reads lazur
  leg cash from world to lazur amount laz_net[q]

move so_pay[o in so, k in month where start_of(k) >= walk_from and plan_to[k]]: transfers
  on so_day[o, k]
  at start_of(k)
  when k <= plan_until and so_day[o, k] >= walk_from and so_runs[o, k]
  leg cash from joint to world amount so_amount[o]

move wage[e in payer, m in month where m >= month_of(walk_from) - 1 and plan_to[m]]: transfers
  on pay_on[e, m]
  at start_of(m)
  when m <= plan_until and pay_on[e, m] >= walk_from
  leg cash from world to joint amount net[e, m]

move zosia_save[m in month where start_of(m) >= walk_from and plan_to[m] and hr4_live[m]]: transfers
  on rule_day[m]
  at start_of(m)
  when m <= plan_until and rule_day[m] >= walk_from and hr4_live[m]
  reads joint
  leg cash from joint to zosia_sav amount min(hr4_amount, max(0, bal(joint) - floor_now[m]))

version walk_start
  cite modeller
  governs always
  known 2021-01-01
  inv_holder[inv_transit] = none "not a fund account"
  opening[inv_transit] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start "a place of the model's own, empty"
  owns[ania, inv_transit] = 0.5 governs 2021-01-01.. "the joint account's money on its way to investing (CIV-1 .2)"
  owns[tomek, inv_transit] = 0.5 governs 2021-01-01.. "the joint account's money on its way to investing (CIV-1 .2)"
  fc_on = false "outside the forecast; the scenario forecast sets it from 2026-01-01"
  plan_until = 2026-12 "GEN-1: the last year whose holidays a row gives (the 2026 row, known 2025-10-16); a 15th or a payday of a later year has a hole for its day, which would make every balance and binding over its kind a hole (G-MP-2, S:306). The scenario forecast assumes the holidays to 2035 and moves it there."
  walk_from = 2026-01-01 assumed "the records end on 2025-12-31 (story); the walk books the model's own movements from the next day" "story 2025-12-31"

version laz_rate_2021
  cite a_d31
  governs always
  known 2021-03-01
  laz_rate = 3.1 %/year governs 2021-03-01.. "A-D31: 3.10 % a year on the daily balance, over 365 days"

version laz_rate_2024
  cite a_d32
  governs always
  known 2023-12-04
  replace laz_rate = 4.2 %/year governs 2024-01-01.. "A-D32: from 1 January 2024, 4.20 % a year"

version laz_stmt_end
  cite laz_sav
  governs always
  known 2025-07-01
  note "story 2025-06-30, known 2025-07-01: the last Lazur statement downloaded; the second half of 2025 wasn't downloaded. The key reads the rate from 2025-07-01 as missing."
  laz_last_stmt = 2025-06-30 "laz-savings-1020-0044-7310.csv line 41"
  replace laz_rate = ?"the Bank Lazur savings rate from 2025-07-01: no statement after 2025-06-30 was downloaded" governs 2025-07-01..

version card_unknown
  cite modeller
  governs always
  known 2026-01-15
  note "the walk's months have no records (they end 2025-12-31) and the story plans no card spending; A-HR1 v2's floor holds a card average, not a plan, and the days are unknown (a window, L §4.4)"
  card_spend[*] = ?"our card spending from the joint account from 2026: no records after 2025-12-31 and no plan for it (story)"
